@startuml
title Публикация поездки: HTTP, outbox, Kafka и inbox
hide footbox

actor "Водитель" as Driver
participant "ShareTrip\nHTTP + service" as ShareTrip
participant "Contract Service" as Contract
database "PostgreSQL\nsharetrip_contract" as ContractDB
database "PostgreSQL\nsharetrip" as AppDB
participant "Outbox publisher\ngoroutine ShareTrip" as Publisher
queue "Kafka\ntrip.events" as Kafka
participant "Notification Service" as Notification

Driver -> ShareTrip: POST /trip/publish {tripId}
ShareTrip -> Contract: POST /contracts/check-service\n{client_id, service_code: trip_creation}
note over ShareTrip, Contract
  X-Request-ID, X-Correlation-ID, X-Trip-ID, traceparent
end note
Contract -> ContractDB: Прочитать договор и доступность услуги
ContractDB --> Contract: Договор и признак enabled
Contract --> ShareTrip: 200 {allowed: true, reason: service_allowed}

group Транзакция публикации
  ShareTrip -> AppDB: BEGIN; SELECT trip FOR UPDATE
  AppDB --> ShareTrip: Поездка
  ShareTrip -> ShareTrip: Проверить DriverID = ClientID\nи статус draft
  ShareTrip -> AppDB: Сохранить published + историю\nINSERT outbox_events (TripPublished, pending)
  ShareTrip -> AppDB: COMMIT
  AppDB --> ShareTrip: Транзакция зафиксирована
end

par HTTP-ответ
  ShareTrip --> Driver: 200 {tripId}\nX-Request-ID, X-Correlation-ID, trace-id
else Фоновая доставка и обработка
  group Транзакция publisher
    Publisher -> AppDB: BEGIN; SELECT pending\nLIMIT 100 FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    AppDB --> Publisher: Сохранённое событие
    Publisher -> Kafka: TripPublished, key=trip_id\npayload + metadata headers
    note over Publisher, Kafka
      event_id, event_type, correlation_id,
      causation_id, traceparent сохраняются при повторах.
    end note
    Kafka --> Publisher: Подтверждение отправки (acks=all)
    Publisher -> AppDB: UPDATE outbox: sent, sent_at; COMMIT
  end

  Notification -> Kafka: FetchMessage(group=notification-service)
  Kafka --> Notification: TripPublished
  Notification -> Notification: Прочитать metadata и trace context

  group Транзакция inbox и уведомления
    Notification -> AppDB: BEGIN; INSERT processed_events(event_id)\nON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    AppDB --> Notification: Результат вставки
    alt Новый event_id
      Notification -> AppDB: INSERT notifications\nrecipient_id=driver_id, status=created
    else Дубль event_id
      Notification -> Notification: Пропустить создание уведомления
    end
    Notification -> AppDB: COMMIT
    AppDB --> Notification: Транзакция зафиксирована
  end

  Notification -> Kafka: CommitMessages(offset)
end

note over AppDB, Notification
  Ошибка сохранения: ROLLBACK, offset не подтверждается.
  После commit БД повтор безопасен благодаря inbox.
  Итог текущей версии — уведомление в БД, без внешней отправки.
end note
@enduml
